      "tagsB": [],
      "comment": "The artwork has a purplish gradient background, the color of a sunset and some nice gold and yellow colors on top for the album's title and the person's hat.\nOption A is basically black and white so it is missing a lot the artworks identity.\nOption B is making a gradient between the purple of the artworks background and the yellow of the artworks foreground and this does not work. They do not have a gradient in the artwork, and the middle colors don't really work ",
      "submittedAt": "2026-07-27T07:06:12.487Z"
    },
    {
      "caseId": "phase4-07-aad2dd34c47d",
